StickyNote {
 inputs 0
 name Vfx_Example1
 label "Scenario: Many AI Video Generators\ntake a start and end frame, making \ncontrollable AI Video Generation \npossible. Preparing those keyframes\nis where the bulk of the work lies.\nWith Bria's fully licensed models \nin Nuke, you can make targeted\nnon-destructive edits and repeatable\nworkflows. Here we show how you\ncan use Bria to prepare your frames\nfor video"
 xpos 3871
 ypos -3059
}
